<title>GREECE: Greek cabinet to decide on OTE float Friday.</title>
<headline>Greek cabinet to decide on OTE float Friday.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Greek cabinet will convene on Friday to finalise its decision on OTE Telecom's second flotation, government spokesman Dimitris Reppas told reporters.</p>
<p>He said up to 25 percent of the telecommunications company could be floated following the 8.0 percent tranche the first time around. &quot;It cannot be ruled out but it is unlikely (that 25 percent will be floated),&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Reppas said investment interest was strong.</p>
<p>OTE shares were up 115 drachmas at 5,960 mid-session on Monday on strong volume. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
